(text "Spare channels: SEL LOW, S/D NC." (at 21.59 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "352d7999-7d05-54fe-add8-d7b07415d300"))
(text "Five pull-ups use SD_3V3; CLK is pulled LOW.\nCard power and SD_IO_EN are independently controlled." (at 163.83 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "39f1e0d7-8d56-5ad0-b52d-b837466e173e"))
(text "DAT3 is not the mechanical detect contact.\nR708/C704 filter contact bounce; firmware still debounces." (at 163.83 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "db506d0e-0d41-54ac-9687-0c6c07c8b629"))
(text "Parallel ESD clamps at the connector; short return to GND." (at 163.83 204.47 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d1563ada-71b9-58fa-8937-7c3c7bc0b645"))
(text "ON: isolate -> power valid -> connect I/O -> initialize. OFF: flush/unmount -> isolate -> power OFF.\nNo UHS 1.8V; begin at 400kHz init, then 4-bit 20MHz target. Values and connectivity unchanged from r5." (at 15.24 270.51 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1d8c10f6-427d-5351-baf2-bcc659bd12b7"))
